WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.872 --> 00:00:09.456
Many wedding parents are wary of "heavy makeup."

2
00:00:09.792 --> 00:00:21.000
Since most don't usually wear much makeup, they worry it will suddenly look too heavy and give them a harsher expression.

3
00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:29.064
When a wedding-parent makeup artist says "natural," they mean doing everything needed while still looking as if you did nothing.

4
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.168
Getting there takes a bit of time to pass.

5
00:00:33.504 --> 00:00:41.928
The instant the brush comes down and you look in the mirror, it can feel unfamiliar and heavy.

6
00:00:42.264 --> 00:00:46.512
That's simply because it is heavier than your everyday look.

7
00:00:46.848 --> 00:00:58.536
But by the time you add the hair styling, changing into your outfit, and travel time, about 20 to 30 percent naturally settles into the skin,

8
00:00:58.872 --> 00:01:02.664
and that settling-in effect is factored in from the start.

9
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:13.200
The goal is to look most natural and beautiful the moment you're standing in the wedding-parent spot, which is why it's applied a bit stronger to begin with.

10
00:01:13.536 --> 00:01:20.784
This finished look only comes together naturally once you're also wearing your wedding-parent outfit.

11
00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:27.432
In short, it may look heavy at first, but it settles into a natural look by the time you're standing there.
